1
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:17,440
If a strategy looks harmful, misleading or copied, you can report it. Open it first.

2
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:20,040
Report is at the bottom of the details.

3
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:26,600
Choose a reason. The seller never sees who reported it.

4
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:31,020
Add details if they help.

5
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:35,380
ActTrader reviews every report and decides what happens.

6
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:39,160
Changed your mind? Undo report takes it back while it is still open.

7
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:42,170
The report is withdrawn.

